1. e4 e5 2. f4 exf4 3. Nf3 g5 4. Bc4 Bg7 5. d4 d6 6. c3 Bg4 7. Nbd2 Nd7 8. h3
Bh5 9. Qb3 Nb6 10. h4 g4 11. Ng1 Ne7 12. Ne2 Nxc4 13. Qxc4 d5 14. Qb3 f3 15.
gxf3 gxf3 16. Nf4 Bg4 17. Rg1 h5 18. Nxd5 Nxd5 19. Qxd5 Qxh4+ 20. Kd1 f2+ 21.
Rxg4 Qxg4+ 22. Kc2 c6 23. Qc4 Bh6 24. Qd3 O-O-O 25. Nf1 Bxc1 26. Rxc1 Rhe8 27.
Nd2 h4 28. Rf1 f5 29. e5 Rxe5 30. Rxf2 Red5 31. Nc4 Qe4 32. Ne3 Qxd3+ 33. Kxd3
Rf8 34. Nxd5 cxd5 35. Ke3 Kd7 36. Rh2 Rh8 37. Kf4 Ke6 38. Kg5 Rg8+ 39. Kxh4
Rh8+ 40. Kg3 Rxh2 41. Kxh2 {"The game was somewhat loosely conducted for
another score moves, and White ultimately resigned." Source: Huddersfield Coll.
Mag., April 1876, p184} 0-1

